    "updated_at": "2024-12-01T15:46:42Z",
    "body": "Sadly I don't think we can do much more than add a few manual tests to WPT, and do whatever vendor-specific testing you can do. I think this PR is good to go % https://github.com/whatwg/console/pull/236/files#r1676151812. @bmeurer does Firefox match Chrome in this case? (I couldn't find where Firefox puts timeStamp() marks on its performance timeline). If it does match Chrome, we can just land this since it would match 2/3 implementations without strong objections from another.",
